' Ditulis manual. State machine status pendaftaran PPDB.
@startuml state-pendaftaran
!include _gaya.iuml
title State Diagram — Status Pendaftaran PPDB (pendaftaran_ppdb.status)

[*] --> SUBMITTED : pengunjung mengirim formulir
SUBMITTED : Diajukan
REVIEW : Ditinjau
REVISION_REQUIRED : Perlu revisi
ACCEPTED : Diterima
REJECTED : Ditolak\n(alasan wajib)
ENROLLED : Menjadi siswa\n(terkunci)

SUBMITTED --> REVIEW : admin meninjau
SUBMITTED --> ACCEPTED
SUBMITTED --> REJECTED
REVIEW --> REVISION_REQUIRED : data kurang
REVISION_REQUIRED --> REVIEW : data dilengkapi
REVIEW --> ACCEPTED : lolos
REVIEW --> REJECTED : tidak lolos
ACCEPTED --> REJECTED : dibatalkan
REJECTED --> REVIEW : ditinjau ulang
ACCEPTED --> ENROLLED : data siswa dibuat\n& id_siswa terhubung
ENROLLED --> [*]
REJECTED --> [*]

note right of ENROLLED
  Setelah ENROLLED status tidak
  dapat diubah lagi. Saat ini
  penandaan ENROLLED dilakukan
  lewat data/proses administrasi,
  belum ada tombol otomatis.
end note
@enduml
